  "notes": "**Hutsix v2.4.0**(released)\n\n### Theme\n- Hutsix now follows your Windows light/dark setting automatically. With the theme set to **Auto**, the app flips between light and dark as soon as Windows does \u2014 no restart needed.\n- Fixed the app staying dark even after Windows switched to light.\n\n### Screen Capture\n- The dashboard and Action Monitor are now hidden from screen capture by default, so recordings and capture-based triggers see the app behind them instead of Hutsix's own windows. You can turn this off in Settings.\n- Reduced capture lag: the latest screen frame is now delivered faster during continuous monitoring.\n\n### Logging\n- Fixed a mislabeled log source in mouse actions so support logs point to the correct module.\n\n### Tests\n- Added tests covering the new capture-exclusion and theme-following behavior.",
